sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User browser
    participant CF as CloudFront (edge)
    participant S3 as S3 frontend (private)
    participant VO as VPC origin
    participant ALB as Internal ALB
    participant API as Fargate task (FastAPI)
    participant DB as RDS PostgreSQL

    U->>CF: GET http://d1w7…cloudfront.net/
    CF-->>U: 301 → https://
    U->>CF: GET https://…/ (TLS)
    alt cache hit
        CF-->>U: index.html from edge cache
    else cache miss
        CF->>S3: GET /index.html (SigV4 signed by OAC)
        Note over S3: bucket policy allows only<br/>cloudfront.amazonaws.com with<br/>SourceArn = this distribution
        S3-->>CF: 200 index.html, app.js, styles.css
        CF-->>U: 200 + HSTS, X-Frame-Options, nosniff
    end

    U->>CF: POST /api/messages {"author","body"}
    Note over CF: /api/* behaviour: caching disabled,<br/>all viewer headers except Host forwarded,<br/>adds X-Origin-Verify (shared secret)
    CF->>VO: forward over the AWS private network
    VO->>ALB: HTTP :80 (SG allows CloudFront prefix list only)
    alt header missing or wrong
        ALB-->>CF: 403 Forbidden (default action)
    else header matches
        ALB->>API: forward to a healthy target on :8000
        API->>API: pydantic validation (1-64 / 1-500 chars), else 422
        API->>DB: INSERT … VALUES (%s, %s) over TLS (sslmode=require)
        DB-->>API: RETURNING id, author, body, created_at
        API-->>ALB: 201 Created (JSON) + JSON access log line → CloudWatch
        ALB-->>CF: 201
        CF-->>U: 201
    end
